      "module": "GRWTSK.RiemannHypothesis.CCC.PrimeBlocks",
      "name": "GRWTSK.RiemannHypothesis.CCC.cascade_insert_before_delay",
      "type": "\u2200 {P : Finset \u2115},\n  (\u2200 p \u2208 P, Nat.Prime p) \u2192\n    \u2200 {p : \u2115}, Nat.Prime p \u2192 p \u2209 P \u2192 \u2200 {u : \u211d}, u \u2264 Real.log \u2191p \u2192 primeNoteCascade (insert p P) u = primeNoteCascade P u"
    },
